      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Storage and content serving is handled via standard CDN services, so content will be cached in regionally-local servers. We can't really \"add more X region download servers\", as that's not quite how it works!\nCan you try using a VPN and see if that helps? Often, odd routing will cause issues. [Cloudflare Warp](https://1.1.1.1/) is a decent, free service that might bounce around poor ISP routing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
