      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nGood Morning Tupper!\nThank you for replying, and yes I did try utilizing a VPN (Nord to be exact) and I had no dice unfortunately, I'm going to see if it is our ISP throttling our download speed back as it's the end of the month.\nBut someone mentioned the servers (For VRC) will be bad or good for Japan. \nDo you have any other work arounds I could attempt to try?\nThank you again!",
