  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-29T09:22:26.532Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Download times for Japan when it comes to avatars and Worlds seem to be either marginally stable and somewhat speedy to outright horrendous and slow (50kbps) slow, and even slower on some days! \nThese bogs can last a week and renders the game nearly unplayable as I can't load ANYONE'S avatar much less join their world. If it is possible to open up more Storage/Servers/Delivery Mirrors here in Japan, specifically the southern portions, that would be wonderful!",
